---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 dark:text-white mt-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Terms and Conditions</h1>

        <aside class="mb-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 p-5 text-gray-800 dark:border-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-white" aria-labelledby="private-service-notice">
            <h2 id="private-service-notice" class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Important notice: private, non-governmental service</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">Sotomayor Consulting International is a private, independent company. We are not a government entity and are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or authorized to represent the United States Government or any other public agency.</p>
            <p>We provide professional guidance, document preparation, and administrative support. We do not issue official documents, decide applications, or guarantee approvals or processing times. When the procedure allows it, users may complete it directly with the official agency without hiring our services.</p>
        </aside>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">By accessing and using the Sotomayor Consulting International website, you agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions of Use. If you do not agree with any of these terms, we ask that you do not use our website.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">2. Nature and Independence of Our Services</h2>
