        <p class="mb-4">Every approval, denial, request for additional information, processing time, and issuance of documents is determined exclusively by the appropriate government authority. Fees charged by Sotomayor Consulting International compensate our private professional services and are separate from applicable government fees, according to the scope and quote provided to the user. When permitted by applicable rules, users retain the option to submit their application directly through the appropriate official website or office.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">All content present on this website, including texts, graphics, logos, images, videos, and software, is the property of Sotomayor Consulting International or is used with permission. This content is protected by intellectual property laws and may not be reproduced, distributed, or transmitted without the express authorization of Sotomayor Consulting International.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">4. Website Use</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">You may use our website solely for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms and Conditions. You agree not to use the website in any manner that may damage, disable, overburden, or impair the server, or interfere with any other party's use and enjoyment of the website.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">The Sotomayor Consulting International website is provided "as is." We make no warranties of any kind, express or implied, as to the operation of the website or the information, content, materials, or products included on it.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Sotomayor Consulting International shall not be liable for any damages of any kind arising from the use of this website, including but not limited to direct, indirect, incidental, punitive, and consequential damages.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">7. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Our website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided solely for your convenience and do not imply endorsement by Sotomayor Consulting International of such sites. We have no control over the content of third-party websites and assume no responsibility for them.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">8. Modifications</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Sotomayor Consulting International reserves the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. We recommend that you review this page periodically to be aware of any changes.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">9. Applicable Law</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the country where Sotomayor Consulting International has its main headquarters, without giving effect to its provisions on conflicts of laws.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">10. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us through the contact information provided on our website.</p>
    </div>
